    "message": "MED-02: scoped SAF attachment operation and viewing integration (OFF) (#119)\n\n* feat(med02): connect scoped attachment operations and owned viewing (OFF)\n\n* feat(med02): integrate isolated SAF operation flow and native acceptance\n\n* fix(med02): bind synthetic document paths and revoke corrupted read leases\n\n* test(med02): corrupt only owned synthetic ciphertext and restore sealed mode\n\n* MED-02: complete explicit SAF target and reopen flow with safe reconciliation\n\n* test(med02): select actual DocumentsUI rows with real touch input\n\n* test(med02): identify injected picker events as touchscreen input\n\n* test(med02): reacquire settled live DocumentsUI nodes before selection\n\n* test(med02): inject explicit finger tool events for modern picker selection\n\n* ci(med02): verify real SAF cases first without duplicating bulk assertions\n\n* test(med02): await actual library readiness before disguise security assertions\n\n* test(med02): retain immediate PIN and target guards throughout readiness wait\n\n* ci(med02): prove rooted emulator identity after bounded adbd reconnect\n\n* test(med02): await committed visit display before exact navigation assertions\n\n* fix(med02): require explicit reconciliation after ambiguous conflicting input\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Celeste Twilight <twilight17342793@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Reah Shirayuki <kurururea@gmail.com>",
